  "tutorial": [
    {
      "text": "Sand, and a supply plane ahead of the first wave. What it drops is yours if you can break it open.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sentry first, on the bend, the way you know.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 4,
        "y": 6
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 4,
        "y": 6,
        "turret": "basic"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is new: a mortar. Twice the price, half the rate of fire, and its shell bursts where it lands — everything near the impact takes it.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "wheel",
        "turret": "heavy"
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8,
        "turret": "heavy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Press Play.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "button",
        "id": "play"
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "running"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Armour is coming behind the first lot. Plated and slow: half of every sentry round bounces off it, and the mortar's blast does not care.",
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the first file come through and see what the mortar does to a bunched-up group.",
      "done": {
        "kind": "kills",
        "count": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now that crate. Tap it, and every gun in reach turns on it — it holds a mortar of its own.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "assigned",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A crate is tougher than a tree. Speed the clock up if you like — the mortar inside is worth the wait.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "voucher",
        "turret": "heavy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Broken open, and the mortar is yours for nothing. Put it where it covers the long run home.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 6,
        "y": 12
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 6,
        "y": 12,
        "turret": "heavy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Brutes last: a wall of meat that shrugs off a quarter of every kinetic hit and walks the whole road. Three guns will not hold this stage — keep queueing while the credits come in.",
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    }
  ],
